This directory contains java sources for the JUtil java utility classes.

This project can be built with either Eclipse or Ant: `ant` builds
jutil-<version>.jar, and `ant javadoc` builds the documentation in api/.

JDK 21 or later is required to build and to run JUtil 2.x.  JUtil 1.5,
the last release of the 1.x line, builds on JDK 1.5 through 8 and runs
on Java 1.5 and later.
